{"event":"changes_requested","job_id":"docs-payment-methods-walley-web-drop-in","reason":"Full 367-line pinned raw, SHA-256, canonical URL, five quotes, field tables, blank-type sample warning, and reciprocal route check out. A material product and lifecycle boundary is missing: the linked Walley overview at raw lines 23\u201332 distinguishes B2C paymentMethod.type walley from B2B walley_b2b, limits DK/DKK to B2C, and says Authorised payments must be captured within 90 days. A query asking which type to use or when to capture would receive only 'use the applicable method type' and no deadline from this candidate/Q2; the child raw leaves type blank and contains no capture deadline, so that raw route alone cannot answer it. This is a narrow related-overview qualification, not a change to the child evidence."}
